### Exact runtime contract

The head pins [`@openai/codex` 0.150.1](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/blob/e7e1e0f8e9cc0e25db2b6876d2d979d13edafc86/extensions/codex/package.json#L12-L18). Tag `rust-v0.150.1` resolves to upstream commit [`90854393966b21e9ebfd21b122334eb09a20c93d`](https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/90854393966b21e9ebfd21b122334eb09a20c93d).

Directly inspected contracts at that immutable commit:

- [`ThreadResumeParams`](https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/90854393966b21e9ebfd21b122334eb09a20c93d/codex-rs/app-server-protocol/src/protocol/v2/thread.rs#L321-L336) resumes by explicit `thread_id` (or history/path, with documented precedence).
- [`TurnInterruptParams`](https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/90854393966b21e9ebfd21b122334eb09a20c93d/codex-rs/app-server-protocol/src/protocol/v2/turn.rs#L206-L212) requires both `thread_id` and `turn_id`.
- [`turn_interrupt_inner`](https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/90854393966b21e9ebfd21b122334eb09a20c93d/codex-rs/app-server/src/request_processors/turn_processor.rs#L1496-L1525) loads the specified thread and rejects a mismatched active turn ID.
- [`ThreadUnsubscribeParams`](https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/90854393966b21e9ebfd21b122334eb09a20c93d/codex-rs/app-server-protocol/src/protocol/v2/thread.rs#L687-L708) is thread-specific.

Relevant source shapes, copied from the pinned commit for offline inspection:

```rust
